GRAMMAR.md §7.1 (DECISIONS 343): consumer_roots names a root project.canon does not declare, and a root twice; it may come before roots.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  consumer_roots: [admin, client, admin]
  roots {
    admin: "../admin"
  }
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E1009]  project.canon:3:27
  consumer_roots: "client" is not a declared root

error[E1009]  project.canon:3:35
  consumer_roots: "admin" is listed twice

2 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
